Ilu
$cards
DECK 4 SPADES

$initial
DRAW 8 ROTATE 3 U U
COLUMN 4 FACE_LAST
COLUMN 3 FACE_LAST

UYEAF 6 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
UYEAF 9 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
UYEAF 9 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
UYEAF 2 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
UYEAF 2 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
UYEAF 9 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

$moves
MOVE UYEAF COLUMN
SRC Suit {HEARTS}
$win
AND
    OR
        PILE ALL UYEAF Empty
        PILE ALL COLUMN Empty
    OR
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
        PILE ALL COLUMN Empty
